 "structural_change": "HBM-HCBANK9 10-20 successor of hbm_hcq_bank_cb_rw (--cts gate FAILED: b0_rp clk_r0 150.2 ps TT over 3 separated clusters; cb_rw clk 136.5 ps TT with the 2.8 k write mass 300-770 um from its W-face pin flops).  One glue root per compact register mass, the mass anchored beside the pins it serves: SRAM read capture beside rd_out (clk_w/clk_x -> clk_r per SRAM row), CPO sums beside the leaf y face (clk_q), lane enables beside lv_i / ss_i (clk_e), CPI sums at the in face (clk_i), write mass on clk_a.  0 added edges.",
